# Web App (`apps/web`)

## Purpose

Public-facing marketing/landing pages and waitlist signup. No authenticated routes. Minimal JavaScript.

## Waitlist

- Landing page waitlist form → `orpc.waitlist.signup` (public)
- Confirmation email links to `/waiting?token=...` (HMAC-signed; no raw email in URL)
- `/login` redirects to dashboard login for returning approved users

## Conventions

- Prefer server components — avoid `"use client"` unless strictly necessary
- `@/*` alias for local imports
- No Zustand, no TanStack Query — static or server-fetched data only
- Port: 3001
